# A `#` is content; only `#{` is a seam.
#
# The C advances over the `#` before it looks for the `{`, so a lone `#`
# is already inside the answer when the decision is made - which means the
# body cannot stop *at* a `#`, only at a `#` that turns out to open a brace.
# The first body is `a#b` and it is three bytes, not one.
roots 1
mends 0
holds quoted_content
spans quoted_content 5 8
spans quoted_content 12 13
